# Agent process

Full text: `docs/guidelines/agents.md`.

- New things that are not obvious (type, helper, name, folder): **2–3 options**, then wait. Do not invent and ship.
- Finish check: names explain themselves; helper with 1–2 vague call sites → inline or rename; fields that travel together = one object, not N state/props; no dead exports; no extra scope.
